# bounces off the garden wall at col 17 and comes back to Resi under the
# box), the Fürberg pilgrim stomped over the wall, group A stomped one by
# one from the terrace below the long terrace (waiting for them to come
# down), the ?-box, the Holzstiege, pair B and #7 stomped in the trough, a
# wait under the rockfall net and timed walks past rocks #2-#4, the
# checkpoint (col 116), the shaft planks with a short wait on the row-23
# plank while Pilger #8 drops past on his zigzag, the boulder top
# (Oblaten), the Einsiedelei (Zaunerstollen, +1 life), the Hackl taken as
# Zuckerschock with a standing jump beside the H-box (164, row 8), the
# Wolfgang pigeon and group C defeated with axes thrown from the box top,
# both saddle Gams defeated with axes, a walk off the Aberseeblick to the
# Maibaum. 51 of 68 Oblaten.
